  "message": "<h3>Congratulations! Your Admission Offer Has Been Issued</h3>\n\n<p>Dear <strong>{{ doc.applicant_name }}</strong>,</p>\n\n<p>We are pleased to inform you that you have been offered admission to the <strong>{{ doc.program }}</strong> programme at <strong>{{ doc.campus }}</strong>.</p>\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Programme</strong></td>\n<td>{{ doc.program }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Campus</strong></td>\n<td>{{ doc.campus }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Offer Valid Until</strong></td>\n<td>{{ frappe.format_value(doc.payment_deadline, {\"fieldtype\":\"Date\"}) }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Admission Fee</strong></td>\n<td>₹{{ frappe.format_value(doc.payable_amount, {\"fieldtype\":\"Currency\"}) }}</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>Please log in to your Applicant Portal to review and accept your admission offer before the deadline.</p>\n\n<p>Failure to complete the acceptance and payment before the deadline may result in cancellation of this offer.</p>\n\n<p>Congratulations and welcome!</p>\n\n<p><strong>Admissions Office</strong></p>",
